@startuml ARCH-07
!include ../theme.puml
title ARCH-07 — Email OTP và SMTP
actor User
component "Verification / recovery controllers" as Controller
component "EmailOtpServiceImpl" as OTP
component "PasswordEncoder" as Hash
component "EmailServiceImpl" as Email
database "email_verification_tokens" as DB
cloud "SMTP provider" as SMTP
collections "Local capture (dev/test)" as Capture
User -> Controller : yêu cầu OTP
Controller -> OTP : generateOtp(email,purpose,IP)
OTP -> OTP : rate limit email/IP + 60s cooldown
OTP -> Hash : BCrypt(6-digit SecureRandom code)
OTP -> DB : lưu hash, expiry 5 phút, maxAttempts=5
OTP -> Email : gửi mã
Email -> Capture : capture mode
Email -> SMTP : SMTP mode / JavaMail
User -> Controller : nộp OTP
Controller -> OTP : verifyOtp
OTP -> DB : latest unused token
OTP -> Hash : matches
OTP -> DB : consume usedAt / increment attempts
@enduml

